Z||000002||RossT||05-25-2001||04:31 AM||||These are the "RPO" codes for your car.  It is like the build sheet.  You can decode it:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.mn.org/Knowledge/Features/Option.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.mn.org/Knowledge/Features/Option.htm</A> <P><BR>It will tell you all the "original" equipment that your car with. If your car has power windows, and there is no RPO code for power windows, then they were most likely added by someone after production.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||1
